        <p><strong>Try it:</strong> <a href="/tool/image-compressor/" style="color:var(--accent);">zippywidgets.online/tool/image-compressor/</a></p>
      </div>

      <h2>How We Evaluated These Tools</h2>

      <p>Every tool on this list was tested against the same criteria:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Format support:</strong> Can it handle JPG, PNG, and WebP?</li>
        <li><strong>No watermark:</strong> Does the compressed image stay clean?</li>
        <li><strong>No forced sign-up:</strong> Can you compress and download without creating an account?</li>
