        <p>ZippyWidgets Image Compressor is a privacy-first tool that runs entirely in your browser. You can adjust quality, resize the image, and convert between JPG, PNG and WebP formats. Because nothing is uploaded, there are no file size limits and no risk of your images being stored on a remote server.</p>
